OL,3,GNEWSAGreenbelt Festival bids farewell
OL,4,Ato Boughton House
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn arts and faith festival which has
OL,7,Fbeen held in the grounds of a stately
OL,8,Fhome since 2014 will be looking for a
OL,9,Fnew venue from 2028.
OL,11,FThe Greenbelt Festival will be having a
OL,12,Fyear off in 2027 while it finds a new
OL,13,Flocation to replace Boughton House near
OL,14,FKettering in Northamptonshire.
OL,16,FTelevision presenter Rev Kate Bottley,
OL,17,Fwho has been a trustee, said: "Boughton
OL,18,FHouse is such a beautiful site, the
OL,19,Ftrees, the house itself, the water
OL,20,Ffeatures, it's just glorious.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
